                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course mainly expounds the basic concepts of management and nursing management, the basic principles and processes of management, the basic theories of management, planning work, organizing work, human resource management, leadership, control, nursing quality management, nursing information management and nursing management, nursing emergency management, and medical and health laws and regulations. Through the teaching of this course, it is hoped that students can understand the basic process of management, become familiar with the basic structure and operation process of the hospital nursing management system through the analysis of management cases, and be able to apply management theories to solve nursing management problems. In course study, case analysis and literature analysis, patriotic feelings, professional spirit and scientific literacy should be demonstrated.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
